Notes:
- `mapConvoBlockReplaceIndex` has a new optional `isEnd` parameter. When content is appended at the end of the file, an earlier change that ends at the old end of file keeps its range instead of growing to include the appended content.
- Find-replace blocks on a missing file now report "not found" instead of a read error, because missing files are treated as empty. This is a side effect of 3a.


